<title>USA: El Paso Energy to cut workforce by 261.</title>
<headline>El Paso Energy to cut workforce by 261.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Paso Energy Corp said on Thursday it is cutting its work force by 261 employees as part of a plan to maximize efficiency.</p>
<p>El Paso said it offered early retirement to eligible employees. Other employees not retained will receive full severance benefits.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
